  "access_steps": [
    "Take the Level 1 orientation and safety training first. To sign up, scan the training QR code on the Maker Space website, or on the door of the building.",
    "After Level 1 comes Level 2, then the level for your tool: Level 3, Level 4 or Level 5. The trainings list shows which."
